                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakandisisya kulubuwa lwaanze kulubazu lwakunyika. Nkabela wakandileta kutwaanda tulangide lubuwa, tulangide mayake aakulubazu­ lwakunyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulamfu bwamayake aakulubazu lwakunyika bwakali tukokola tuli mwanda, abwaamba bwakali tukokola tuli makumi osanwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubusena bulangene tukokola tuli makumi obile twalubuwa lwamukati, bulangene ibbuwa lyakulubuwa lwaanze, kamuli inzila mumilongo yoonse yotatwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kunembo lyatwaanda kakuli mwenya wakwiinda mukati; bwaamba bwawo bwakali tukokola tuli ikumi, abulamfu bwawo bwakali tukokola tuli mwanda, amilyango kiilangide kunyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela twaanda twakujulu twakafwimpa-fwimpa nkaambo inzila yakatola busena kulintuto kwiinda kutwaanda twaansi atwaakati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo twakali mumilongo yotatwe, alimwi katujisi minsende mbuli minsende yalubuwa lwaanze; nkambo kako twaanda twakujulu twakalisyanikide kwiinda twaanda twaansi atwaakati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kakuli lubaya anze lulangide twaanda, kumbali lyalubuwa lwaanze, lulangide twaanda. Bulamfu bwalo bwakali tukokola tuli makumi osanwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo bulamfu bwatwaanda twakulubuwa lwaanze bwakali tukokola tuli makumi osanwe, atootu tuli kunembo lyantempele twakali tukokola tuli mwaanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kunsi lyatwaanda otu kakuli manjililo kujwe, nkonkuko nkobakali kunjilila kuzwa kulubuwa lwaanze; lubaya nkolwakagolela,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
