                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bapaizi banjila buyo mubusena busalala, tabeelede kuzwa alimwi kukunjila mulubuwa lwaanze cita bataangune kusamununa zyakusama nzibakasamide ciindi cakucita milimo, nkaambo zilasalala. Baleelede kusama zyakusama zimbi nibatana kusika kufwaafwi kubantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
